---
layout: base.njk
title: AgricToday — GreenMinds Media
description: Practical agriculture news, ideas and opportunity for a growing Africa.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="eyebrow">GREENMINDS MEDIA PRESENTS</span>
    <h1>Agric<span>Today</span></h1>
    <p>Where agriculture meets opportunity.</p>
    <a class="button" href="#latest">Explore the latest <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-note">Growing knowledge.<br>Growing futures.</div>
</section>
<section class="intro">
  <div><span class="eyebrow green">THE FIELD NOTES</span><h2>Better insights.<br><em>Stronger harvests.</em></h2></div>
  <p>AgricToday is the media home of GreenMinds — sharing useful stories, fresh perspectives and practical ideas for farmers, agripreneurs and everyone shaping the future of food.</p>
</section>
<section id="latest" class="latest">
  <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow green">FROM THE FIELD</span><h2>Latest stories</h2></div><span class="section-caption">Ideas for a changing agricultural world</span></div>
  <div class="article-grid">
  {% for post in collections.articles | reverse %}
    <article class="article-card">
      <a class="article-image" href="{{ post.url }}">{% if post.data.thumbnail %}<img src="{{ post.data.thumbnail }}" alt="">{% else %}<div class="image-placeholder"><span>AGRIC<br><b>TODAY</b></span><i>✳</i></div>{% endif %}<span class="category">{{ post.data.category or "Field Notes" }}</span></a>
      <div class="article-copy"><div class="meta">{{ post.date | dateReadable }} · {{ post.data.author or "AgricToday Desk" }}</div><h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p><a class="read-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read story <span>↗</span></a></div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if collections.articles.length == 0 %}
    <div class="empty-state"><div class="empty-icon">✳</div><h3>Your first story starts here.</h3><p>Use the content studio to publish news, farm stories, market updates and ideas. Your articles will appear here automatically.</p><a class="button dark" href="/admin/">Open content studio ↗</a></div>
  {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="newsletter"><div><span class="eyebrow">STAY IN THE KNOW</span><h2>Good things grow<br>when we share.</h2></div><p>Follow the ideas, people and innovations moving agriculture forward. Have a story worth telling? We’d love to hear from you.</p><a class="button light" href="mailto:hello@greenminds.example?subject=AgricToday%20story%20pitch">Pitch a story ↗</a></section>
<footer class="footer"><a class="footer-brand" href="/">GREENMINDS <span>MEDIA</span></a><p>AgricToday — planting ideas, growing futures.</p><a href="/admin/">Contributor login ↗</a><small>© {{ "now" | date: "%Y" }} GreenMinds Media. All rights reserved.</small></footer>
